      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "67d35fcec5276f902076443c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For those trying to get cinematic shots in VRChat for roleplay or other reasons it would be seriously helpful to have a button on player end that can fully hide the floating camera lenses of others so they are not a distraction. I understand why you would want the lenses visible but an option to locally turn them off on player end would be so useful for filming/streaming/taking photos.",
