      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "67d35fe09d42985cd2447b18",
      "mergedPostDetails": "A toggle in the settings to hide other players' camera pills would be very useful. I understand the safety reasons why the pill exists, but if I have to choose and toggle other people's cameras off myself, and it defaults to on, then there should be no issue.\n\nIn large streamed lobbies, especially Roleplays, you might have 10-20 camera pills hovering around in front of your face, clipping into your face, and obstructing the game. It becomes incredibly frustrating.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Hide other Players' Cameras",
