      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add onto this, it would be great if we could have a separate option to hide your own handheld camera, while leaving nameplates on...\n\nI usually want to take a picture where everyone's names are still shown above them, but the camera object becomes a nuisance that you have to try and hide behind you, which can be impossible depending on how you're trying to take a picture.\n\nA simple toggle to have the game hide its active object visibility during the frame the photo is taken would be wonderful (and perhaps an option to turn OFF \"backface\" rendering of it, so you can still easily frame your shot, but not have it block the view of you or scenery.",
