  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Under \"UI Elements\" I think there should be a button to toggle other user's cameras from appearing on my end. \nMany people use cameras while streaming and often times the camera, and little nameplate that goes with it, end up blocking out my screen and forcing me to use the \"Disable Nameplates\" option. \nHowever that only removes the little camera nameplate and leaves me guessing who I'm talking with.",
